inputFields.description:
Filter object in the following format:
`"filter" : {
"fieldName1": "value1",
"fieldName2":{"$operator":"value2"}
}`
Example of operators: `$eq`, `$ne`, `$lt`, `$lte`, `$gt`, `$gte`, `$in`, `$hasSome`, `$hasAll`, `$startsWith`, `$contains`

Filter for variants. See [API Query Language](https://dev.wix.com/docs/api-reference/articles/work-with-wix-apis/data-retrieval/about-the-wix-api-query-language)
for WQL syntax and [Search Variants](https://dev.wix.com/docs/api-reference/business-solutions/stores/catalog-v3/product-variants-reader/search-variants)
for available filter fields.

